{"id": "unknown-2026-08-21-038", "date": "2026-08-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["expand", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh mandates solar charging for millions of electric rickshaws", "content": "<p>Bangladesh plans to require millions of battery-powered auto-rickshaws to use solar-powered charging stations as a condition of registration, aiming to reduce pressure on the electricity grid. Industry representatives say the policy could spur investment in solar charging infrastructure, create jobs and expand renewable energy, while urging the government to include net metering.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/bangladesh-mandates-solar-charging-for-millions-of", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/bangladesh-mandates-solar-charging-for-millions-of-electric-rickshaws/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-21-039", "date": "2026-08-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Solar powerhouse to storage leader", "content": "<p>Chile is transforming in a bid to avoid becoming a victim of its own solar success. Developers have flooded the Atacama Desert with solar projects, turning Chile into a PV powerhouse but also drastically reducing revenues and driving some operators into bankruptcy. S&#38;P Global Energy’s Ángel Cancino sees the country increasingly focusing on energy storage to rescue some of its overbuilt PV capacity.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/solar-powerhouse-to-storage", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/21/solar-powerhouse-to-storage-leader/", "type": "rss"}]}
